### 채널 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamId": 1,
  "projectId": 1,
  "name": "cowork",
  "viewType": "TEXT",
  "description": "협업 도구 개발 팀",
  "isPrivate": false
}

### 채널 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 채널 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork",
  "description": "협업 도구 개발 팀",
  "projectId": 1,
  "detachProject": false
}

### 채널 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 비공개 채널 멤버 추가
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}

### 채널 멤버 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 채널 멤버 제거 또는 채널 나가기
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/members/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
